# rena0-tap-shot — F1-3 fixture
# Expectations cite the recovered rows and the State-400 body's own timing: Rena+0's
# ground tap binds move 400 (Fighter::shot_move_id; the air tap is 402), the row is bound
# by update 12, and the body's weapon-0 branch requests its projectile at frame 12
# (battle_rena_ground_shot.hpp:40-44). This build spawns the shot on update 13, which is
# the body's frame 12 once the press update is frame 0 — recorded as agreement between the
# recovered frame number and the production path, not as an original-runtime comparison.
combo 0 0
seed 5489
spawn 0 0 0 0
spawn 1 0 0 2000
collision open-field
input 0 SHOOT
input 1 -
expect 12 shot_row 400
expect 13 shots 1
expect 13 shot_fired 1
expect 13 shot_tier 0
expect 13 main_whole 5
expect 13 shot_bullet_row 0
expect 20 dummy_static 1
